# The pursuing drone. 28x28, drawn 1:1, radial like the player.
#
# Same size and same symmetry as the player, and the only difference is hue:
# warm rust body, alarm-red eye. In an arena where a dozen of these converge
# from off-screen, shape has no time to do any work — the player reads
# warm-versus-cool and nothing else, and that is the fight.
name shooter-enemy
size 28 28
key o outline
key R rust-1-shadow
key r rust-2
key A alarm-1
pixels
